        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>When Alekin's Aspect spawns, it gains an emotional attunement based on Alekin's current HP.</p><p>This determines the damage type of the Aspect's attack and the bonus granted by their Manifest Emotion and Emotional Aura abilities.</p><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"224\"><p><strong>Boss HP Percentage</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Aspect</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"224\"><p>80%</p></td><td><p>Aspect of Anger</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"224\"><p>60%</p></td><td><p>Aspect of Bargain</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"224\"><p>40%</p></td><td><p>Aspect of Denial</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
        },
