        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The effect of this ability depends on the Aspect's emotion.</p><p><strong>Aspect of Anger</strong></p><p>Select up to 4 unoccupied consecutive squares within the Aspect's Emotional Aura and set them on fire. Any creature entering or starting their turn in one of these squares takes @Damage[8d6] with a @Check[reflex|dc:29|basic|options:damaging-effect].</p><p>For the purpose of Aspect of Bargain, each set of four squares counts as a single effect.</p><p><strong>Aspect of Bargain</strong></p><p>The Aspect counteracts up to 2 magical effects created by Alekin or an Aspect within the Aspect's Emotional Aura, and then heal Alekin by two times the counteracted effect's level for each counteracted effect.</p><p><strong>Aspect of Denial</strong></p><p>Select up to 2 unoccupied consecutive squares within in the Aspect's Emotional Aura. Each of these squares becomes surrounded by a transparent wall of force (See Wall of Denial for stats). All four walls surrounding any of these squares count as a single segment for the purpose of tracking HP.</p><p>For the purpose of Aspect of Bargain, each set of two squares squares counts as a single effect.</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "authors": "",
          "license": "OGL",
          "remaster": false,
          "title": ""
