        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Aspect empowers its Emotional Aura. Until the start of its next turn, all numeric effects of this Aspect's Emotional Aura are doubled.</p><p>Only one Empower Emotion can be active at any given time, any subsequent uses of Empower Emotion (Even by other Aspects) override any existing Empower Emotion effects.</p>"
