        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Aspect's attunement to its emotions is so powerful, its influence expands far beyond its own body. Creatures within 60 feet of the Aspect are constantly under an effect depending on the Aspect's emotion.</p><p>These effects end immediately when the Aspect is destroyed, or when an affected creatures leaves the aura.</p><p><strong>Aspect of Anger: </strong>All allies are under the effect of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.IAjvwqgiDr3qGYxY]{Courageous Anthem}.</p><p><strong>Aspect of Bargain: </strong>All enemies gain a Weakness to all damage equal to half their level.</p><p><strong>Aspect of Denial: </strong>All allies are under the effect of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.bH0kPuf7UKxRvi2P]{Rallying Anthem}.</p>"
        },
